        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dick Crealy, Richard Crealy, Mary Pierce, Peaches Bartkowicz\n- Events: Australian Open, 1970 Australian Davis Cup Team, Olympic Games, 1970 Swedish Open\n- Organizations: Women's Tennis Association\n- Roles: Australian former tennis player, French retired tennis professional\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Crealy was born on 18 September 1944 and is an Australian former tennis player.\n- Richard Crealy reached the Australian Open final in 1970.\n- Richard Crealy was a member of the 1970 Australian Davis Cup Team.\n- Richard Crealy won four Grand Slam doubles titles.\n- Peaches Bartkowicz and Dick Crealy won the singles titles at the 1970 Swedish Open.\n- Mary Pierce was born on 15 January 1975 and is a French retired tennis professional.\n- Mary Pierce played on the Women's Tennis Association tour.\n- Mary Pierce represented France in team competitions and at the Olympic Games.",
